<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-11T18:38:47.454Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:38:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent attacks have intensified in Sudan's border regions, with a paramilitary drone strike killing dozens near the Ethiopian frontier and multiple airstrikes on gold mining sites along the Sudan-Egypt border killing and wounding miners. The Rapid Support Forces are identified as the drone attacker, while the Sudanese Armed Forces are implicated in the airstrikes on civilian mining operations. Humanitarian statements note the growing threat to civilians in West Kordofan and the border triangle region. The conflict has already produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8vgx9ew571wo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNUFBfVzRteUl3YWdXNU1yUWFndHZoOHVsSEdxSmZnZDdfeDRNcGdpcjJjel9hZ1pMRVgtVDBQZUVBWGVmNlhFZDNIdkFrdV91aFQyVUxwVDN2MFZSSzlMbVZoYnJHS05PVW1oRVZzcWNOUEphbEtHaWo2Q19lWnE0a1UzVVYzbGdqMldpaFN2TmlEZXBydnl6V3BZR3BPSkU3VThRNEJYcHF6bEIzdTNBczBTelJVUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPZnR1bUFvZHdMOU0tQnhCVDlvQktjN0JKVEhwS1JfZDgtS09YSFUwdC1DSHNVN1l3LXJNdmdsMjhXaHNkSkQzQnRFVFQydmM2dUVrTFVPVHV5Mkc1R0NQc2xvSjFEY1hFR0FmXy12cU0tS2xIWUx3WW4ya1RmX3RWcVRfTUhpaXFZTG43TVlTZGVXUktP?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQZmlic3BqamlLOUo5NllTUUp4SlNiWUwyRWdveDN3cUVqRTBua29oTVM5T25XRmZqdUx4V0RKQloxRElRQnR2TGViejl0VV9iMWE5QmpNd1p5OTNvNkxmR2VrQ1dFYk5SRXU0ZG9wWUoxZm9CbFBZVlNKTXVQb2ZtelJia2lIeFNrVVk5UmJmaVZwc3p4LXFHenVyMHplVDVUeGd0al82UzVzdGZGUTV3eklKQjN4SFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOWDdORkRiTWZEMEozRXo5N1IzOS1MUTlfUGI4TXpYNzk4THNsaUR4ODZKU2JkaE